\pmo \v 8 \rb Remember,|זְכָר־\rb* \rb I pray,|נָא֙\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the word|הַדָּבָ֔ר\rb* \rb that|אֲשֶׁ֥ר\rb* \rb You commanded|צִוִּ֛יתָ\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb Your servant|עַבְדְּךָ֖\rb* \rb Moses|מֹשֶׁ֥ה\rb* \rb when You said,|לֵאמֹ֑ר\rb* \rb ‘If you|אַתֶּ֣ם\rb* \rb are unfaithful,|תִּמְעָ֔לוּ\rb* \rb I|אֲנִ֕י\rb* \rb will scatter|אָפִ֥יץ\rb* \rb you|אֶתְכֶ֖ם\rb* \rb among the nations,|בָּעַמִּֽים׃\rb* \v 9 \rb but if you return|וְשַׁבְתֶּ֣ם\rb* \rb to Me|אֵלַ֔י\rb* \rb and keep|וּשְׁמַרְתֶּם֙\rb* \rb and practice|וַעֲשִׂיתֶ֖ם\rb*\rb |אֹתָ֑ם\rb* \rb My commandments,|מִצְוֺתַ֔י\rb* \rb then even if|אִם־\rb* \rb your exiles|נִֽדַּחֲכֶ֜ם\rb* \rb have been|יִהְיֶ֨ה\rb* \rb banished to the farthest|בִּקְצֵ֤ה\rb* \rb horizon,|הַשָּׁמַ֙יִם֙\rb*\f + \fr 1:9 \ft Or \fqa to the extremity of the heavens\f* \rb I will gather them|אֲקַבְּצֵ֔ם\rb* \rb from there|מִשָּׁ֣ם\rb* \rb and bring them|וַהֲבוֹאֹתִים\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb the place|הַמָּק֔וֹם\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֣ר\rb* \rb I have chosen|בָּחַ֔רְתִּי\rb* \rb as a dwelling|לְשַׁכֵּ֥ן\rb* \rb for|אֶת־\rb* \rb My Name.’|שְׁמִ֖י\rb*\f + \fr 1:9 \ft \ref Deuteronomy 30:1–4|DEU 30:1-4\ref*\f*
