\p \v 70 \rb Some of|וּמִקְצָת֙\rb* \rb the heads|רָאשֵׁ֣י\rb* \rb of the families|הָֽאָב֔וֹת\rb* \rb contributed|נָתְנ֖וּ\rb* \rb to the project.|לַמְּלָאכָ֑ה\rb* \rb The governor|הַתִּרְשָׁ֜תָא\rb* \rb gave|נָתַ֣ן\rb* \rb to the treasury|לָאוֹצָ֗ר\rb* \rb 1,000|אֶ֙לֶף֙\rb* \rb darics|דַּרְכְּמֹנִ֥ים\rb* \rb of gold,|זָהָ֞ב\rb*\f + \fr 7:70 \ft Or \fqa 1,000 gold drachmas\ft ; that is, approximately 18.5 pounds or 8.4 kilograms of gold coins\f* \rb 50|חֲמִשִּׁ֔ים\rb* \rb bowls,|מִזְרָק֣וֹת\rb* \rb and 530|שְׁלֹשִׁ֖ים\rb*\rb |וַחֲמֵ֥שׁ\rb*\rb |מֵאֽוֹת׃\rb* \rb priestly|כֹּֽהֲנִ֔ים\rb* \rb garments.|כָּתְנוֹת֙\rb* \v 71 \rb And some of the heads|וּמֵֽרָאשֵׁ֣י\rb* \rb of the families|הָֽאָב֗וֹת\rb* \rb gave|נָֽתְנוּ֙\rb* \rb to the treasury|לְאוֹצַ֣ר\rb* \rb for the project|הַמְּלָאכָ֔ה\rb* \rb 20,000|שְׁתֵּ֣י\rb*\rb |רִבּ֑וֹת\rb* \rb darics|דַּרְכְּמוֹנִ֖ים\rb* \rb of gold|זָהָ֕ב\rb*\f + \fr 7:71 \ft Or \fqa 20,000 gold drachmas\ft ; that is, approximately 370.4 pounds or 168 kilograms of gold coins; also in verse 72 \f* \rb and 2,200|אַלְפַּ֥יִם\rb*\rb |וּמָאתָֽיִם׃\rb* \rb minas|מָנִ֖ים\rb* \rb of silver.|וְכֶ֕סֶף\rb*\f + \fr 7:71 \ft Or \fqa 2,200 silver minas\ft ; that is, approximately 1.38 tons or 1.25 metric tons of silver\f* \v 72 \rb |וַאֲשֶׁ֣ר\rb* \rb The rest|שְׁאֵרִ֣ית\rb* \rb of the people|הָעָם֒\rb* \rb gave a total of|נָתְנוּ֮\rb* \rb 20,000|שְׁתֵּ֣י\rb*\rb |רִבּ֔וֹא\rb* \rb darics|דַּרְכְּמוֹנִים֙\rb* \rb of gold,|זָהָ֗ב\rb* \rb 2,000|אַלְפָּ֑יִם\rb* \rb minas|מָנִ֣ים\rb* \rb of silver,|וְכֶ֖סֶף\rb*\f + \fr 7:72 \ft Or \fqa 2,000 silver minas\ft ; that is, approximately 1.26 tons or 1.14 metric tons of silver\f* \rb and 67|שִׁשִּׁ֥ים\rb*\rb |וְשִׁבְעָֽה׃פ\rb* \rb priestly|כֹּֽהֲנִ֖ים\rb* \rb garments.|וְכָתְנֹ֥ת\rb*
\p \v 73 \rb So the priests,|הַכֹּהֲנִ֣ים\rb* \rb Levites,|וְהַלְוִיִּ֡ם\rb* \rb gatekeepers,|וְהַשּׁוֹעֲרִים֩\rb* \rb singers,|וְהַמְשֹׁרְרִ֨ים\rb* \rb and temple servants,|וְהַנְּתִינִ֛ים\rb* \rb along with some|וּמִן־\rb* \rb of the people|הָעָ֧ם\rb* \rb and the rest of|וְכָל־\rb* \rb the Israelites,|יִשְׂרָאֵ֖ל\rb* \rb settled|וַיֵּשְׁב֣וּ\rb* \rb in their own towns.|בְּעָרֵיהֶ֑ם\rb* \rb And by the seventh|הַשְּׁבִיעִ֔י\rb* \rb month|הַחֹ֣דֶשׁ\rb*\rb |וַיִּגַּע֙\rb* \rb the Israelites|וּבְנֵ֥י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵ֖ל\rb* \rb had settled in their towns.|בְּעָרֵיהֶֽם׃\rb*
