\li1 \rb Adaiah|וַ֠עֲדָיָה\rb* \rb son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Jeroham,|יְרֹחָ֤ם\rb* \rb the son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Pelaliah,|פְּלַלְיָה֙\rb* \rb the son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Amzi,|אַמְצִ֣י\rb* \rb the son|בֶן־\rb* \rb of Zechariah,|זְכַרְיָ֔ה\rb* \rb the son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Pashhur,|פַּשְׁח֖וּר\rb* \rb the son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Malchijah;|מַלְכִּיָּֽה׃\rb* \v 13 \rb and his associates,|וְאֶחָיו֙\rb* \rb the leaders|רָאשִׁ֣ים\rb* \rb of families—|לְאָב֔וֹת\rb*  \rb 242 men;|מָאתַ֖יִם\rb*\rb |אַרְבָּעִ֣ים\rb*\rb |וּשְׁנָ֑יִם\rb*
\li1 \rb Amashai|וַעֲמַשְׁסַ֧י\rb* \rb son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Azarel,|עֲזַרְאֵ֛ל\rb* \rb the son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Ahzai,|אַחְזַ֥י\rb* \rb the son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Meshillemoth,|מְשִׁלֵּמ֖וֹת\rb* \rb the son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Immer;|אִמֵּֽר׃\rb* \v 14 \rb and his associates|וַאֲחֵיהֶם֙\rb*\f + \fr 11:14 \ft Most LXX manuscripts; Hebrew \fqa their associates\f* — \rb 128|מֵאָ֖ה\rb*\rb |עֶשְׂרִ֣ים\rb*\rb |וּשְׁמֹנָ֑ה\rb* \rb mighty men|גִּבּ֣וֹרֵי\rb* \rb of valor.|חַ֔יִל\rb* \rb Zabdiel|זַבְדִּיאֵ֖ל\rb* \rb son of|בֶּן־\rb* \rb Haggedolim|הַגְּדוֹלִֽים׃ס\rb* \rb was their overseer.|וּפָקִ֣יד\rb*\rb |עֲלֵיהֶ֔ם\rb*
\p \v 15 \rb From|וּמִֽן־\rb* \rb the Levites:|הַלְוִיִּ֑ם\rb*
\pmo \rb Shemaiah|שְׁמַעְיָ֧ה\rb* \rb son|בֶן־\rb* \rb of Hasshub,|חַשּׁ֛וּב\rb* \rb the son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Azrikam,|עַזְרִיקָ֥ם\rb* \rb the son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Hashabiah,|חֲשַׁבְיָ֖ה\rb* \rb the son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Bunni;|בּוּנִּֽי׃\rb* \v 16 \rb Shabbethai|וְשַׁבְּתַ֨י\rb* \rb and Jozabad,|וְיוֹזָבָ֜ד\rb* \rb two leaders|מֵרָאשֵׁ֖י\rb* \rb of the Levites,|הַלְוִיִּֽם׃\rb* \rb who supervised|עַל־\rb* \rb the work|הַמְּלָאכָ֤ה\rb* \rb outside|הַחִֽיצֹנָה֙\rb* \rb the house|לְבֵ֣ית\rb* \rb of God;|הָאֱלֹהִ֔ים\rb* \v 17 \rb Mattaniah|וּמַתַּנְיָ֣ה\rb* \rb son|בֶן־\rb* \rb of Mica,|מִ֠יכָה\rb* \rb the son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Zabdi,|זַבְדִּ֨י\rb* \rb the son|בֶן־\rb* \rb of Asaph,|אָסָ֜ף\rb* \rb who led|רֹ֗אשׁ\rb*\rb |הַתְּחִלָּה֙\rb* \rb in thanksgiving|יְהוֹדֶ֣ה\rb* \rb and prayer;|לַתְּפִלָּ֔ה\rb* \rb Bakbukiah,|וּבַקְבֻּקְיָ֖ה\rb* \rb second|מִשְׁנֶ֣ה\rb* \rb among his associates;|מֵאֶחָ֑יו\rb* \rb and Abda|וְעַבְדָּא֙\rb* \rb son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Shammua,|שַׁמּ֔וּעַ\rb* \rb the son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Galal,|גָּלָ֖ל\rb* \rb the son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Jeduthun.|יְדִיתוּן׃\rb* \v 18 \rb The Levites|הַלְוִיִּם֙\rb* \rb in the holy|הַקֹּ֔דֶשׁ\rb* \rb city|בְּעִ֣יר\rb* \rb totaled|כָּל־\rb* \rb 284.|מָאתַ֖יִם\rb*\rb |שְׁמֹנִ֥ים\rb*\rb |וְאַרְבָּעָֽה׃פ\rb*
\p \v 19 \rb And the gatekeepers:|וְהַשּֽׁוֹעֲרִים֙\rb*
\pmo \rb Akkub,|עַקּ֣וּב\rb* \rb Talmon,|טַלְמ֔וֹן\rb* \rb and their associates,|וַאֲחֵיהֶ֖ם\rb* \rb who kept watch|הַשֹּׁמְרִ֣ים\rb* \rb at the gates—|בַּשְּׁעָרִ֑ים\rb*  \rb 172 men.|מֵאָ֖ה\rb*\rb |שִׁבְעִ֥ים\rb*\rb |וּשְׁנָֽיִם׃\rb*
\s1 Residents Outside Jerusalem
\p \v 20 \rb The rest|וּשְׁאָ֨ר\rb* \rb of the Israelites,|יִשְׂרָאֵ֜ל\rb* \rb with the priests|הַכֹּהֲנִ֤ים\rb* \rb and Levites,|הַלְוִיִּם֙\rb* \rb were in all|בְּכָל־\rb* \rb the villages|עָרֵ֣י\rb* \rb of Judah,|יְהוּדָ֔ה\rb* \rb each|אִ֖ישׁ\rb* \rb on his own inheritance.|בְּנַחֲלָתֽוֹ׃\rb* \v 21 \rb The temple servants|וְהַנְּתִינִ֖ים\rb* \rb lived|יֹשְׁבִ֣ים\rb* \rb on the hill of Ophel,|בָּעֹ֑פֶל\rb* \rb with Ziha|וְצִיחָ֥א\rb* \rb and Gishpa|וְגִשְׁפָּ֖א\rb* \rb over|עַל־\rb* \rb them.|הַנְּתִינִֽים׃פ\rb*
\p \v 22 \rb Now the overseer|וּפְקִ֤יד\rb* \rb of the Levites|הַלְוִיִּם֙\rb* \rb in Jerusalem|בִּיר֣וּשָׁלִַ֔ם\rb* \rb was Uzzi|עֻזִּ֤י\rb* \rb son|בֶן־\rb* \rb of Bani,|בָּנִי֙\rb* \rb the son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Hashabiah,|חֲשַׁבְיָ֔ה\rb* \rb the son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Mattaniah,|מַתַּנְיָ֖ה\rb* \rb the son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Mica.|מִיכָ֑א\rb*\f + \fr 11:22 \fqa Mica \ft is a variant of \fqa Micaiah\ft ; see \ref Nehemiah 12:35|NEH 12:35\ref*.\f* \rb He was one of Asaph’s|אָסָף֙\rb* \rb descendants,|מִבְּנֵ֤י\rb* \rb who were the singers|הַמְשֹׁ֣רְרִ֔ים\rb* \rb in charge|לְנֶ֖גֶד\rb* \rb of the service|מְלֶ֥אכֶת\rb* \rb of the house|בֵּית־\rb* \rb of God.|הָאֱלֹהִֽים׃\rb* \v 23 \rb For|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb there was a command|מִצְוַ֥ת\rb* \rb from the king|הַמֶּ֖לֶךְ\rb* \rb concerning the singers,|עֲלֵיהֶ֑ם\rb* \rb an ordinance|וַאֲמָנָ֥ה\rb* \rb regulating|עַל־\rb* \rb their|הַמְשֹׁרְרִ֖ים\rb* \rb daily|י֥וֹם\rb*\rb |בְּיוֹמֽוֹ׃\rb* \rb activities.|דְּבַר־\rb* \v 24 \rb Pethahiah|וּפְתַֽחְיָ֨ה\rb* \rb son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Meshezabel,|מְשֵֽׁיזַבְאֵ֜ל\rb* \rb a descendant|מִבְּנֵי־\rb* \rb of Zerah|זֶ֤רַח\rb* \rb son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Judah,|יְהוּדָה֙\rb* \rb was the king’s|הַמֶּ֔לֶךְ\rb* \rb agent|לְיַ֣ד\rb*\f + \fr 11:24 \ft Hebrew \fqa hand\f* \rb in every|לְכָל־\rb* \rb matter|דָּבָ֖ר\rb* \rb concerning the people.|לָעָֽם׃\rb*
\p \v 25 \rb As for|וְאֶל־\rb* \rb the villages|הַחֲצֵרִ֖ים\rb* \rb with their fields,|בִּשְׂדֹתָ֑ם\rb* \rb some of the people|מִבְּנֵ֣י\rb* \rb of Judah|יְהוּדָ֗ה\rb* \rb lived|יָֽשְׁב֞וּ\rb*\rb |בְּקִרְיַ֤ת\rb* \rb in Kiriath-arba,|הָֽאַרְבַּע֙\rb*\rb |וּבְנֹתֶ֔יהָ\rb* \rb Dibon,|וּבְדִיבֹן֙\rb*\rb |וּבְנֹתֶ֔יהָ\rb* \rb Jekabzeel,|וּבִֽיקַּבְצְאֵ֖ל\rb* \rb and their villages;|וַחֲצֵרֶֽיהָ׃\rb* \v 26 \rb in Jeshua,|וּבְיֵשׁ֥וּעַ\rb* \rb Moladah,|וּבְמוֹלָדָ֖ה\rb*\rb |וּבְבֵ֥ית\rb* \rb and Beth-pelet;|פָּֽלֶט׃\rb* \v 27 \rb |וּבַחֲצַ֥ר\rb* \rb in Hazar-shual;|שׁוּעָ֛ל\rb*\rb |וּבִבְאֵ֥ר\rb* \rb in Beersheba|שֶׁ֖בַע\rb* \rb and its villages;|וּבְנֹתֶֽיהָ׃\rb* \v 28 \rb in Ziklag;|וּבְצִֽקְלַ֥ג\rb* \rb in Meconah|וּבִמְכֹנָ֖ה\rb* \rb and its villages;|וּבִבְנֹתֶֽיהָ׃\rb* \v 29 \rb |וּבְעֵ֥ין\rb* \rb in En-rimmon,|רִמּ֛וֹן\rb* \rb Zorah,|וּבְצָרְעָ֖ה\rb* \rb Jarmuth,|וּבְיַרְמֽוּת׃\rb* \v 30 \rb Zanoah,|זָנֹ֤חַ\rb* \rb Adullam,|עֲדֻלָּם֙\rb* \rb and their villages;|וְחַצְרֵיהֶ֔ם\rb* \rb in Lachish|לָכִישׁ֙\rb* \rb and its fields;|וּשְׂדֹתֶ֔יהָ\rb* \rb and in Azekah|עֲזֵקָ֖ה\rb* \rb and its villages.|וּבְנֹתֶ֑יהָ\rb* \rb So they settled|וַיַּחֲנ֥וּ\rb*\rb |מִבְּאֵֽר־\rb* \rb from Beersheba|שֶׁ֖בַע\rb* \rb all the way to|עַד־\rb* \rb the Valley|גֵּֽיא־\rb* \rb of Hinnom.|הִנֹּֽם׃\rb*
\p \v 31 \rb The descendants|וּבְנֵ֥י\rb* \rb of Benjamin|בִנְיָמִ֖ן\rb* \rb from Geba|מִגָּ֑בַע\rb* \rb lived in Michmash,|מִכְמָ֣שׂ\rb* \rb Aija,|וְעַיָּ֔ה\rb*\rb |וּבֵֽית־\rb* \rb and Bethel|אֵ֖ל\rb* \rb with its villages;|וּבְנֹתֶֽיהָ׃\rb* \v 32 \rb in Anathoth,|עֲנָת֥וֹת\rb* \rb Nob,|נֹ֖ב\rb* \rb Ananiah,|עֲנָֽנְיָֽה׃\rb* \v 33 \rb Hazor,|חָצ֥וֹר׀\rb* \rb Ramah,|רָמָ֖ה\rb* \rb Gittaim,|גִּתָּֽיִם׃\rb* \v 34 \rb Hadid,|חָדִ֥יד\rb* \rb Zeboim,|צְבֹעִ֖ים\rb* \rb Neballat,|נְבַלָּֽט׃\rb* \v 35 \rb Lod,|לֹ֥ד\rb* \rb and Ono;|וְאוֹנ֖וֹ\rb* \rb and in the Valley|גֵּ֥י\rb* \rb of the Craftsmen.|הַחֲרָשִֽׁים׃\rb*\f + \fr 11:35 \ft Hebrew \fqa in Ge-harashim\f*
\p \v 36 \rb And some|וּמִן־\rb* \rb divisions|מַחְלְק֥וֹת\rb* \rb of the Levites|הַלְוִיִּ֔ם\rb* \rb of Judah|יְהוּדָ֖ה\rb* \rb settled in Benjamin.|לְבִנְיָמִֽין׃פ\rb*
\c 12
\s1 The Priests and Levites Who Returned
\p \v 1 \rb Now these|וְאֵ֙לֶּה֙\rb* \rb are the priests|הַכֹּהֲנִ֣ים\rb* \rb and Levites|וְהַלְוִיִּ֔ם\rb* \rb who|אֲשֶׁ֥ר\rb* \rb went up|עָל֛וּ\rb* \rb with|עִם־\rb* \rb Zerubbabel|זְרֻבָּבֶ֥ל\rb* \rb son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Shealtiel|שְׁאַלְתִּיאֵ֖ל\rb* \rb and with Jeshua:|וְיֵשׁ֑וּעַ\rb*
\b 
\li1 \rb Seraiah,|שְׂרָיָ֥ה\rb* \rb Jeremiah,|יִרְמְיָ֖ה\rb* \rb Ezra,|עֶזְרָֽא׃\rb*
\li1 \v 2 \rb Amariah,|אֲמַרְיָ֥ה\rb* \rb Malluch,|מַלּ֖וּךְ\rb*\f + \fr 12:2 \fqa Malluch \ft is a variant of \fqa Malluchi\ft ; see verse 14.\f* \rb Hattush,|חַטּֽוּשׁ׃\rb*
\li1 \v 3 \rb Shecaniah,|שְׁכַנְיָ֥ה\rb* \rb Rehum,|רְחֻ֖ם\rb*\f + \fr 12:3 \fqa Rehum \ft is a variant of \fqa Harim\ft ; see verse 15, \ref Nehemiah 7:42|NEH 7:42\ref*, and Ezra 2:39.\f* \rb Meremoth,|מְרֵמֹֽת׃\rb*
\li1 \v 4 \rb Iddo,|עִדּ֥וֹא\rb* \rb Ginnethon,|גִנְּת֖וֹי\rb*\f + \fr 12:4 \ft Many Hebrew manuscripts and Vulgate (see also verse 16); most MT manuscripts \fqa Ginnethoi\f* \rb Abijah,|אֲבִיָּֽה׃\rb*
\li1 \v 5 \rb Mijamin,|מִיָּמִ֥ין\rb*\f + \fr 12:5 \fqa Mijamin \ft is a variant of \fqa Miniamin\ft ; see verse 17.\f* \rb Maadiah,|מַֽעַדְיָ֖ה\rb*\f + \fr 12:5 \fqa Maadiah \ft is a variant of \fqa Moadiah\ft ; see verse 17.\f* \rb Bilgah,|בִּלְגָּֽה׃\rb*\f + \fr 12:5 \fqa Bilgah \ft is a variant of \fqa Bilgai\ft ; also in verse 18; see \ref Nehemiah 10:8|NEH 10:8\ref*.\f*
\li1 \v 6 \rb Shemaiah,|שְׁמַֽעְיָ֥ה\rb* \rb Joiarib,|וְיוֹיָרִ֖יב\rb* \rb Jedaiah,|יְדַֽעְיָֽה׃\rb*
\li1 \v 7 \rb Sallu,|סַלּ֣וּ\rb* \rb Amok,|עָמ֔וֹק\rb* \rb Hilkiah,|חִלְקִיָּ֖ה\rb* \rb and Jedaiah.|יְדַֽעְיָ֑ה\rb*
\b 
\li1 \rb These|אֵ֣לֶּה\rb* \rb were the leaders|רָאשֵׁ֧י\rb* \rb of the priests|הַכֹּהֲנִ֛ים\rb* \rb and their associates|וַאֲחֵיהֶ֖ם\rb* \rb in the days|בִּימֵ֥י\rb* \rb of Jeshua.|יֵשֽׁוּעַ׃פ\rb*
\p \v 8 \rb The Levites were|וְהַלְוִיִּ֗ם\rb* \rb Jeshua,|יֵשׁ֧וּעַ\rb* \rb Binnui,|בִּנּ֛וּי\rb* \rb Kadmiel,|קַדְמִיאֵ֥ל\rb* \rb Sherebiah,|שֵׁרֵבְיָ֖ה\rb* \rb Judah,|יְהוּדָ֣ה\rb* \rb and Mattaniah,|מַתַּנְיָ֑ה\rb* \rb who,|ה֥וּא\rb* \rb with his associates,|וְאֶחָֽיו׃\rb* \rb led|עַֽל־\rb* \rb the songs of thanksgiving.|הֻיְּד֖וֹת\rb* \v 9 \rb Bakbukiah|וּבַקְבֻּֽקְיָ֨ה\rb* \rb and Unni,|וְעֻנּוֹ\rb* \rb their associates,|אֲחֵיהֶ֛ם\rb* \rb stood across from them|לְנֶגְדָּ֖ם\rb* \rb in the services.|לְמִשְׁמָרֽוֹת׃\rb*
\b 
\li1 \v 10 \rb Jeshua|וְיֵשׁ֖וּעַ\rb* \rb was the father of|הוֹלִ֣יד\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb Joiakim,|יֽוֹיָקִ֑ים\rb*
\li1 \rb Joiakim|וְיֽוֹיָקִים֙\rb* \rb was the father of|הוֹלִ֣יד\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb Eliashib,|אֶלְיָשִׁ֔יב\rb*
\li1 \rb Eliashib|וְאֶלְיָשִׁ֖יב\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb was the father of Joiada,|יוֹיָדָֽע׃\rb*
\li1 \v 11 \rb Joiada|וְיוֹיָדָע֙\rb* \rb was the father of|הוֹלִ֣יד\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb Jonathan,|יוֹנָתָ֔ן\rb*\f + \fr 12:11 \fqa Jonathan \ft is a variant of \fqa Johanan\ft ; see verse 22.\f*
\li1 \rb and Jonathan|וְיוֹנָתָ֖ן\rb* \rb was the father of|הוֹלִ֥יד\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb Jaddua.|יַדּֽוּעַ׃\rb*
\p \v 12 \rb In the days|וּבִימֵי֙\rb* \rb of Joiakim,|יֽוֹיָקִ֔ים\rb* \rb these were|הָי֥וּ\rb* \rb the heads|רָאשֵׁ֣י\rb* \rb of the priestly|כֹהֲנִ֖ים\rb* \rb families:|הָאָב֑וֹת\rb*
\b 
\li1 \rb of the family of Seraiah,|לִשְׂרָיָ֣ה\rb* \rb Meraiah;|מְרָיָ֔ה\rb*
