\li1 \rb and of Jedaiah,|לִֽידַֽעְיָ֖ה\rb* \rb Nethanel.|נְתַנְאֵֽל׃\rb*
\p \v 22 \rb In the days|בִּימֵ֨י\rb* \rb of Eliashib,|אֶלְיָשִׁ֜יב\rb* \rb Joiada,|יוֹיָדָ֤ע\rb* \rb Johanan,|וְיוֹחָנָן֙\rb*\f + \fr 12:22 \fqa Johanan \ft is a variant of \fqa Jonathan\ft ; see verse 11.\f* \rb and Jaddua,|וְיַדּ֔וּעַ\rb* \rb during|עַל־\rb* \rb the reign of|מַלְכ֖וּת\rb* \rb Darius|דָּרְיָ֥וֶשׁ\rb* \rb the Persian,|הַפָּֽרְסִֽי׃פ\rb* \rb the heads|רָאשֵׁ֣י\rb* \rb of the families|אָב֑וֹת\rb* \rb of the Levites|הַלְוִיִּם֩\rb* \rb and priests|וְהַכֹּ֣הֲנִ֔ים\rb* \rb were recorded.|כְּתוּבִ֖ים\rb*
\p \v 23 \rb As for the descendants|בְּנֵ֤י\rb* \rb of Levi,|לֵוִי֙\rb* \rb the family|הָֽאָב֔וֹת\rb* \rb heads|רָאשֵׁ֣י\rb* \rb up to|וְעַד־\rb* \rb the days|יְמֵ֖י\rb* \rb of Johanan|יֽוֹחָנָ֥ן\rb* \rb son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Eliashib|אֶלְיָשִֽׁיב׃\rb* \rb were recorded|כְּתוּבִ֕ים\rb* \rb in|עַל־\rb* \rb the Book|סֵ֖פֶר\rb* \rb of the Chronicles.|דִּבְרֵ֣י\rb*\f + \fr 12:23 \ft Or \fqa the Book of the Annals \ft or \fqa the Book of the Historical Events\f* \rb |הַיָּמִ֑ים\rb*\v 24 \rb The leaders|וְרָאשֵׁ֣י\rb* \rb of the Levites|הַ֠לְוִיִּם\rb* \rb were Hashabiah,|חֲשַׁבְיָ֨ה\rb* \rb Sherebiah,|שֵֽׁרֵבְיָ֜ה\rb* \rb and Jeshua|וְיֵשׁ֤וּעַ\rb* \rb son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Kadmiel,|קַדְמִיאֵל֙\rb*\f + \fr 12:24 \ft Or \fqa Sherebiah, Jeshua, Binnui, and Kadmiel\f* \rb along with their associates,|וַאֲחֵיהֶ֣ם\rb* \rb who stood across from them|לְנֶגְדָּ֔ם\rb* \rb to give praise|לְהַלֵּ֣ל\rb* \rb and thanksgiving|לְהוֹד֔וֹת\rb* \rb as one section|מִשְׁמָ֖ר\rb* \rb alternated with|לְעֻמַּ֥ת\rb* \rb the other,|מִשְׁמָֽר׃\rb* \rb as prescribed|בְּמִצְוַ֖ת\rb* \rb by David|דָּוִ֣יד\rb* \rb the man|אִישׁ־\rb* \rb of God.|הָאֱלֹהִ֑ים\rb*
\p \v 25 \rb Mattaniah,|מַתַּנְיָ֧ה\rb* \rb Bakbukiah,|וּבַקְבֻּֽקְיָ֛ה\rb* \rb Obadiah,|עֹבַדְיָ֥ה\rb* \rb Meshullam,|מְשֻׁלָּ֖ם\rb* \rb Talmon,|טַלְמ֣וֹן\rb* \rb and Akkub|עַקּ֑וּב\rb* \rb were gatekeepers|שֽׁוֹעֲרִים֙\rb* \rb who guarded|שֹׁמְרִ֤ים\rb*\rb |מִשְׁמָ֔ר\rb* \rb the storerooms|בַּאֲסֻפֵּ֖י\rb* \rb at the gates.|הַשְּׁעָרִֽים׃\rb* \v 26 \rb They served|אֵ֕לֶּה\rb* \rb in the days|בִּימֵ֛י\rb* \rb of Joiakim|יוֹיָקִ֥ים\rb* \rb son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Jeshua,|יֵשׁ֖וּעַ\rb* \rb the son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Jozadak,|יוֹצָדָ֑ק\rb*\f + \fr 12:26 \fqa Jozadak \ft is a variant of \fqa Jehozadak\ft ; see \ref 1 Chronicles 6:14|1CH 6:14\ref*.\f* \rb and in the days|וּבִימֵי֙\rb* \rb of Nehemiah|נְחֶמְיָ֣ה\rb* \rb the governor|הַפֶּחָ֔ה\rb* \rb and Ezra|וְעֶזְרָ֥א\rb* \rb the priest|הַכֹּהֵ֖ן\rb* \rb and scribe.|הַסּוֹפֵֽר׃פ\rb*
\s1 The Dedication of the Wall
\p \v 27 \rb At the dedication|וּבַחֲנֻכַּ֞ת\rb* \rb of the wall|חוֹמַ֣ת\rb* \rb of Jerusalem,|יְרוּשָׁלִַ֗ם\rb* \rb the Levites|הַלְוִיִּם֙\rb* \rb were sought out|בִּקְשׁ֤וּ\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb from all|מִכָּל־\rb* \rb their homes|מְק֣וֹמֹתָ֔ם\rb* \rb and brought|לַהֲבִיאָ֖ם\rb* \rb to Jerusalem|לִֽירוּשָׁלִָ֑ם\rb* \rb to celebrate|לַעֲשֹׂ֨ת\rb* \rb the joyous|וְשִׂמְחָה֙\rb* \rb dedication|חֲנֻכָּ֤ה\rb* \rb with thanksgiving|וּבְתוֹד֣וֹת\rb* \rb and singing,|וּבְשִׁ֔יר\rb* \rb accompanied by cymbals,|מְצִלְתַּ֖יִם\rb* \rb harps,|נְבָלִ֥ים\rb* \rb and lyres.|וּבְכִנֹּרֽוֹת׃\rb* \v 28 \rb |בְּנֵ֖י\rb* \rb The singers were also|הַמְשֹׁרְרִ֑ים\rb* \rb assembled|וַיֵּאָ֣סְפ֔וּ\rb* \rb from|וּמִן־\rb* \rb the region|הַכִּכָּר֙\rb* \rb around|סְבִיב֣וֹת\rb* \rb Jerusalem,|יְרוּשָׁלִַ֔ם\rb* \rb from|וּמִן־\rb* \rb the villages|חַצְרֵ֖י\rb* \rb of the Netophathites,|נְטֹפָתִֽי׃\rb* \v 29 \rb from Beth-gilgal,|וּמִבֵּית֙\rb*\rb |הַגִּלְגָּ֔ל\rb* \rb and from the fields|וּמִשְּׂד֥וֹת\rb* \rb of Geba|גֶּ֖בַע\rb* \rb and Azmaveth,|וְעַזְמָ֑וֶת\rb* \rb for|כִּ֣י\rb* \rb they|הַמְשֹׁ֣רֲרִ֔ים\rb* \rb had built|בָּנ֤וּ\rb* \rb villages|חֲצֵרִ֗ים\rb* \rb for themselves|לָהֶם֙\rb* \rb around|סְבִיב֖וֹת\rb* \rb Jerusalem.|יְרוּשָׁלִָֽם׃\rb* \v 30 \rb After the priests|הַכֹּהֲנִ֖ים\rb* \rb and Levites|וְהַלְוִיִּ֑ם\rb* \rb had purified themselves,|וַיִּֽטַּהֲר֔וּ\rb* \rb they purified|וַֽיְטַהֲרוּ֙\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the people,|הָעָ֔ם\rb*\rb |וְאֶת־\rb* \rb the gates,|הַשְּׁעָרִ֖ים\rb*\rb |וְאֶֽת־\rb* \rb and the wall.|הַחוֹמָֽה׃\rb*
\p \v 31 \rb Then I brought the leaders|שָׂרֵ֣י\rb* \rb of Judah|יְהוּדָ֔ה\rb* \rb up|וָאַעֲלֶה֙\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb on|מֵעַ֖ל\rb* \rb the wall,|לַחוֹמָ֑ה\rb* \rb and I appointed|וָאַעֲמִ֡ידָה\rb* \rb two|שְׁתֵּ֣י\rb* \rb great|גְּדוֹלֹ֨ת\rb* \rb thanksgiving choirs.|תוֹדֹת֩\rb* \rb One was to proceed|וְתַהֲלֻכֹ֤ת\rb* \rb along the top|מֵעַ֣ל\rb* \rb of the wall|לַחוֹמָ֔ה\rb*\f + \fr 12:31 \ft Or \fqa alongside the wall\ft ; also in verse 38\f* \rb to the right,|לַיָּמִין֙\rb* \rb toward the Dung|הָאַשְׁפֹּֽת׃\rb* \rb Gate.|לְשַׁ֖עַר\rb* \v 32 \rb Hoshaiah|הוֹשַׁ֣עְיָ֔ה\rb* \rb and half|וַחֲצִ֖י\rb* \rb the leaders|שָׂרֵ֥י\rb* \rb of Judah|יְהוּדָֽה׃\rb* \rb followed,|וַיֵּ֤לֶךְ\rb*\rb |אַחֲרֵיהֶם֙\rb* \v 33 \rb along with Azariah,|וַעֲזַרְיָ֥ה\rb* \rb Ezra,|עֶזְרָ֖א\rb* \rb Meshullam,|וּמְשֻׁלָּֽם׃\rb* \v 34 \rb Judah,|יְהוּדָה֙\rb* \rb Benjamin,|וּבִנְיָמִ֔ן\rb* \rb Shemaiah,|וּֽשְׁמַֽעְיָ֖ה\rb* \rb Jeremiah,|וְיִרְמְיָֽה׃ס\rb* \v 35 \rb and some of the priests|הַכֹּהֲנִ֖ים\rb*\rb |וּמִבְּנֵ֥י\rb* \rb with trumpets,|בַּחֲצֹצְר֑וֹת\rb* \rb and also Zechariah|זְכַרְיָ֨ה\rb* \rb son|בֶן־\rb* \rb of Jonathan,|יֽוֹנָתָ֜ן\rb* \rb the son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Shemaiah,|שְׁמַֽעְיָ֗ה\rb* \rb the son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Mattaniah,|מַתַּנְיָה֙\rb* \rb the son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Micaiah,|מִ֣יכָיָ֔ה\rb*\f + \fr 12:35 \fqa Micaiah \ft is a variant of \fqa Mica\ft ; see \ref Nehemiah 11:22|NEH 11:22\ref*.\f* \rb the son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Zaccur,|זַכּ֖וּר\rb* \rb the son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Asaph,|אָסָֽף׃\rb* \v 36 \rb and his associates—|וְֽאֶחָ֡יו\rb* \rb Shemaiah,|שְֽׁמַעְיָ֡ה\rb* \rb Azarel,|וַעֲזַרְאֵ֡ל\rb* \rb Milalai,|מִֽלֲלַ֡י\rb* \rb Gilalai,|גִּֽלֲלַ֡י\rb* \rb Maai,|מָעַ֞י\rb* \rb Nethanel,|נְתַנְאֵ֤ל\rb* \rb Judah,|וִֽיהוּדָה֙\rb* \rb and Hanani—|חֲנָ֔נִי\rb* \rb with the musical|שִׁ֥יר\rb* \rb instruments|בִּכְלֵי־\rb* \rb prescribed by David|דָּוִ֖יד\rb* \rb the man|אִ֣ישׁ\rb* \rb of God.|הָאֱלֹהִ֑ים\rb* \rb Ezra|וְעֶזְרָ֥א\rb* \rb the scribe|הַסּוֹפֵ֖ר\rb* \rb led the procession.|לִפְנֵיהֶֽם׃\rb* \v 37 \rb At|וְעַל֩\rb* \rb the Fountain|הָעַ֜יִן\rb*\rb |וְנֶגְדָּ֗ם\rb* \rb Gate|שַׁ֨עַר\rb* \rb they went directly up|עָלוּ֙\rb*\rb |עַֽל־\rb* \rb the steps|מַעֲלוֹת֙\rb* \rb of the City|עִ֣יר\rb* \rb of David|דָּוִ֔יד\rb* \rb on the ascent|בַּֽמַּעֲלֶ֖ה\rb* \rb to the wall|לַחוֹמָ֑ה\rb* \rb and passed above|מֵעַל֙\rb* \rb the house|לְבֵ֣ית\rb* \rb of David|דָּוִ֔יד\rb* \rb to|וְעַ֛ד\rb* \rb the Water|הַמַּ֖יִם\rb* \rb Gate|שַׁ֥עַר\rb* \rb on the east.|מִזְרָֽח׃\rb*
\p \v 38 \rb The second|הַשֵּׁנִ֛ית\rb* \rb thanksgiving choir|וְהַתּוֹדָ֧ה\rb* \rb proceeded|הַהוֹלֶ֥כֶת\rb* \rb to the left,|לְמ֖וֹאל\rb* \rb and I|וַאֲנִ֣י\rb* \rb followed|אַחֲרֶ֑יהָ\rb* \rb it with half|וַחֲצִ֨י\rb* \rb the people|הָעָ֜ם\rb* \rb along the top|מֵעַ֣ל\rb* \rb of the wall,|לְהַחוֹמָ֗ה\rb* \rb past|מֵעַל֙\rb* \rb the Tower|לְמִגְדַּ֣ל\rb* \rb of the Ovens|הַתַּנּוּרִ֔ים\rb* \rb to|וְעַ֖ד\rb* \rb the Broad|הָרְחָבָֽה׃\rb* \rb Wall,|הַחוֹמָ֥ה\rb* \v 39 \rb over|וּמֵעַ֣ל\rb* \rb the Gate|לְשַֽׁעַר־\rb* \rb of Ephraim,|אֶ֠פְרַיִם\rb*\rb |וְעַל־\rb* \rb the Jeshanah|הַיְשָׁנָ֜ה\rb* \rb Gate,|שַׁ֨עַר\rb*\f + \fr 12:39 \ft Or \fqa the Old City Gate\f*\rb |וְעַל־\rb* \rb the Fish|הַדָּגִ֗ים\rb* \rb Gate,|שַׁ֣עַר\rb* \rb the Tower|וּמִגְדַּ֤ל\rb* \rb of Hananel,|חֲנַנְאֵל֙\rb* \rb and the Tower|וּמִגְדַּ֣ל\rb* \rb of the Hundred,|הַמֵּאָ֔ה\rb* \rb as far|וְעַ֖ד\rb* \rb as the Sheep|הַצֹּ֑אן\rb* \rb Gate.|שַׁ֣עַר\rb* \rb And they stopped|וְעָ֣מְד֔וּ\rb* \rb at the Gate|בְּשַׁ֖עַר\rb* \rb of the Guard.|הַמַּטָּרָֽה׃\rb*
\p \v 40 \rb The two|שְׁתֵּ֥י\rb* \rb thanksgiving choirs|הַתּוֹדֹ֖ת\rb* \rb then stood|וַֽתַּעֲמֹ֛דְנָה\rb* \rb in the house|בְּבֵ֣ית\rb* \rb of God,|הָאֱלֹהִ֑ים\rb* \rb as did I,|וַאֲנִ֕י\rb* \rb along with the half|וַחֲצִ֥י\rb* \rb of the officials|הַסְּגָנִ֖ים\rb* \rb accompanying me,|עִמִּֽי׃\rb* \v 41 \rb as well as the priests|וְהַכֹּהֲנִ֡ים\rb* \rb with their trumpets—|בַּחֲצֹצְרֽוֹת׃\rb*  \rb Eliakim,|אֶלְיָקִ֡ים\rb* \rb Maaseiah,|מַעֲשֵׂיָ֡ה\rb* \rb Miniamin,|מִ֠נְיָמִין\rb* \rb Micaiah,|מִיכָיָ֧ה\rb* \rb Elioenai,|אֶלְיוֹעֵינַ֛י\rb* \rb Zechariah,|זְכַרְיָ֥ה\rb* \rb and Hananiah—|חֲנַנְיָ֖ה\rb*  \v 42 \rb and also Maaseiah,|וּמַעֲשֵׂיָ֨ה\rb* \rb Shemaiah,|וּֽשְׁמַֽעְיָ֜ה\rb* \rb Eleazar,|וְאֶלְעָזָ֧ר\rb* \rb Uzzi,|וְעֻזִּ֛י\rb* \rb Jehohanan,|וִֽיהוֹחָנָ֥ן\rb* \rb Malchijah,|וּמַלְכִּיָּ֖ה\rb* \rb Elam,|וְעֵילָ֣ם\rb* \rb and Ezer.|וָעָ֑זֶר\rb* \rb Then the choirs|הַמְשֹׁ֣רְרִ֔ים\rb* \rb sang out|וַיַּשְׁמִ֙יעוּ֙\rb* \rb under the direction|הַפָּקִֽיד׃\rb* \rb of Jezrahiah.|וְיִֽזְרַחְיָ֖ה\rb*
\p \v 43 \rb On that|הַ֠הוּא\rb* \rb day|בַיּוֹם־\rb* \rb they offered|וַיִּזְבְּח֣וּ\rb* \rb great|גְּדוֹלִ֜ים\rb* \rb sacrifices,|זְבָחִ֨ים\rb* \rb rejoicing|וַיִּשְׂמָ֗חוּ\rb* \rb because|כִּ֤י\rb* \rb God|הָאֱלֹהִים֙\rb* \rb had given them great|גְדוֹלָ֔ה\rb* \rb joy.|שִׂמְּחָם֙\rb*\rb |שִׂמְחָ֣ה\rb* \rb The women|הַנָּשִׁ֛ים\rb* \rb and children|וְהַיְלָדִ֖ים\rb* \rb also|וְגַ֧ם\rb* \rb rejoiced,|שָׂמֵ֑חוּ\rb* \rb so that the joy|שִׂמְחַ֥ת\rb* \rb of Jerusalem|יְרוּשָׁלִַ֖ם\rb* \rb was heard|וַתִּשָּׁמַ֛ע\rb* \rb from afar.|מֵרָחֽוֹק׃\rb*
\s1 Provisions for Temple Worship
\p \v 44 \rb And on that same|הַה֨וּא\rb* \rb day|בַיּוֹם֩\rb* \rb men|אֲנָשִׁ֜ים\rb* \rb were appointed|וַיִּפָּקְד֣וּ\rb* \rb over|עַל־\rb* \rb the rooms|הַנְּשָׁכ֗וֹת\rb* \rb that housed the supplies,|לָא֨וֹצָר֥וֹת\rb* \rb contributions,|לַתְּרוּמוֹת֮\rb* \rb firstfruits,|לָרֵאשִׁ֣ית\rb* \rb and tithes.|וְלַמַּֽעַשְׂרוֹת֒\rb* \rb The portions specified by|מְנָא֣וֹת\rb* \rb the Law|הַתּוֹרָ֔ה\rb* \rb for the priests|לַכֹּהֲנִ֖ים\rb* \rb and Levites|וְלַלְוִיִּ֑ם\rb* \rb were gathered|לִכְנ֨וֹס\rb* \rb into these storerooms|בָּהֶ֜ם\rb* \rb from the fields|לִשְׂדֵ֤י\rb* \rb of the villages,|הֶעָרִים֙\rb* \rb because|כִּ֚י\rb* \rb Judah|יְהוּדָ֔ה\rb* \rb rejoiced|שִׂמְחַ֣ת\rb* \rb over|עַל־\rb* \rb the priests|הַכֹּהֲנִ֥ים\rb*\rb |וְעַל־\rb* \rb and Levites|הַלְוִיִּ֖ם\rb* \rb who were serving.|הָעֹמְדִֽים׃\rb*
\p \v 45 \rb They performed|וַֽיִּשְׁמְר֞וּ\rb* \rb the service|מִשְׁמֶ֤רֶת\rb* \rb of their God|אֱלֹֽהֵיהֶם֙\rb* \rb and the service|וּמִשְׁמֶ֣רֶת\rb* \rb of purification,|הַֽטָּהֳרָ֔ה\rb* \rb along with the singers|וְהַמְשֹׁרְרִ֖ים\rb* \rb and gatekeepers,|וְהַשֹּׁעֲרִ֑ים\rb* \rb as David|דָּוִ֖יד\rb* \rb and his son|בְנֽוֹ׃\rb* \rb Solomon|שְׁלֹמֹ֥ה\rb* \rb had prescribed.|כְּמִצְוַ֥ת\rb* \v 46 \rb For|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb long ago,|מִקֶּ֑דֶם\rb* \rb in the days|בִימֵ֥י\rb* \rb of David|דָוִ֛יד\rb* \rb and Asaph,|וְאָסָ֖ף\rb* \rb there were directors|רֹאשׁ\rb* \rb for the singers|הַמְשֹׁ֣רְרִ֔ים\rb* \rb and for the songs|וְשִׁיר־\rb* \rb of praise|תְּהִלָּ֥ה\rb* \rb and thanksgiving|וְהֹד֖וֹת\rb* \rb to God.|לֵֽאלֹהִֽים׃\rb*
